@host = http://localhost:5223/SchoolManagementSystem


### Register School
POST {{host}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "schoolname":"Plerom",
  "adminFirstName": "Mecy",
  "adminLastName": "Ownkwe",
  "adminEmail": "test@gmail.com",
  "adminPassWord": "11121"
}

### Login User
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Email":"teacher12@seed.school.test",
  "PassWord":"SEEDED_PLACEHOLDER_HASH"
}

### Get All Users and Id
GET {{host}}/users?id=1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..o3eqwkrB_RwKg_C3J0yLzE6b-mjA76DNZkc4DBh2wU0
  
### Get User by Id
GET {{host}}/users/562
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..o3eqwkrB_RwKg_C3J0yLzE6b-mjA76DNZkc4DBh2wU0
  
### Get User by Id
DELETE {{host}}/users/500
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..o3eqwkrB_RwKg_C3J0yLzE6b-mjA76DNZkc4DBh2wU0
  
